Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:27.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパラート！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:30.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強くなんかないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:33.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパレード！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:36.16,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}いつか君を捕まえる！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:54.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}油断したら　その指　チクチクアタック　覚悟して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:02:00.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}小さいけど　挟むの　ミジンコみたいなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:04.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}欲しいのは　プラスチックなハート
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,670)}プラス　プラス　ダケドマイナス
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:13.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}でもそれじゃつまらない　そこに気付いた者勝ち
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}恋は甘くて　苦いもの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:22.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}単純明快　複雑怪奇な代物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どうでもいい事ばっかり気にしたりするの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:28.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どんな感じ？ソンな感じ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:31.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}温厚篤実　エキセントリックなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:34.66,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強がる素振りを全身まとって太刀打ち
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}素直なだけだと刺激が強くて　クラクラ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:43.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}傷ついちゃうの　傷つけちゃうの　純情プレパラート
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:49.05,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}頭の中は　いつも一人の　純情プレパレード
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:27.37,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Praparat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:30.36,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我完全就不堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:33.49,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Pre-Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:36.16,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我終究會把你攬入懷裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:54.17,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}敢大意的話就做好覺悟  你的手指就會受到刺針般的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:02:00.14,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}雖然你像水蚤一樣小隻  不過還是能夾起來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:04.58,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}想要的  是那顆塑膠內心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.58,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,55)}Plus Plus  卻還是Minus
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:13.95,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}只是那樣是百般無聊  發現這點的就是贏家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.68,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}戀愛是甜蜜中夾帶苦澀的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:22.68,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}是單純明快且複雜奇怪的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.63,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}總會在意些無關重要的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:28.67,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}是什麼感覺？就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:31.67,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}溫厚老實且稀奇古怪的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:34.66,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}硬要逞強不斷全力揮棒與我較量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.68,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}你說自己很坦率  這個太過刺激讓你頭暈眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:43.11,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}快要受傷了  快要傷害你了  純情的Praparat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:49.05,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}腦海中一直只有一個人  純情的Pre-Parade
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:30.91,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}バニラソルトで Burning Love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:38.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいだけなら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:43.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:50.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}誰よりももっともっと私を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:53.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知って欲しいからさらけだしたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.81,0:23:57.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも出来ないの　経験Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:23:58.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}モドカシすぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:05.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも、アマいだけの愛はちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:13.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}私が求めているモノとは違う
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.05,0:24:17.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}シロと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:20.63,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}クロだって言っちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.85,0:24:24.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}素直になれない
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.45,0:24:26.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマノジャク
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:30.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}スキと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:34.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ダイキライだって
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:40.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しいのにナニ言ってんだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:47.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいバニラに
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.39,0:24:52.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけるよに…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:30.91,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}香草加點鹽  讓愛火燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:38.52,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果只有甜味太過單調的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:43.56,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就加一點鹽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:50.26,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想讓你比起別人都能更加了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:53.81,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所以想把自己的一切全盤展示出來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.81,0:23:57.11,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是我做不到  因為經驗是零
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:23:58.79,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}讓人看著心急
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:05.82,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是  甜蜜的愛情只有一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:13.52,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}跟我追求的東西不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.05,0:24:17.21,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果你說是白色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:20.63,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會說是黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.85,0:24:24.03,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}無法變得坦率起來
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.45,0:24:26.39,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}最喜歡鬧彆扭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:30.94,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你說喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:34.35,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會回覆最討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:40.21,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明明內心很高興  我怎麼會說那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:47.22,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}在甜甜的香草上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.39,0:24:52.21,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}撒一點鹽吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:56.78,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1019,425)\fad(462,462)}虎與龍
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.05,0:25:06.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H5C5C5C&\pos(912,523)}龍兒與大河
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在這個世界上  有著誰也沒見到的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord2\shad0\fscy110\fsp3\3c&HA17036&\c&HF9F3EC&\pos(504,67.143)\frz24.62}輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord2\shad0\fscy110\fsp3\3c&HA17036&\c&HF9F3EC&\frz24.62\pos(601.143,71.714)}漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord2\shad0\fscy110\fsp3\fs30\3c&HA17036&\c&HF9F3EC&\frz32.9\pos(539.428,218.001)}且柔和的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord1\shad0\fscy110\fsp3\fs28\3c&HA17036&\c&HF9F3EC&\frz27.75\pos(596.57,556.287)}將她的心輕輕抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這種玩意…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:32.97,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord0\shad0\fscy110\fsp0\fs40\c&H4B413F&\frz8.239\pos(705.141,245.43)}霉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事  都發霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明明前陣子才除過霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那是很溫柔  非常甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:39.42,Comment,,0,0,0,,抹布  抹布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大概  如果能看到的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,任何人都會想要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,正因為如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,世界才會將其藏了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓我們無法輕易獲得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡  弄不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.59,Comment,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.78,Comment,,0,0,0,,只要有高須棒的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是總有一天會被人發現
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,應該得到的那個唯一的人  一定能將其找出來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就像這樣發現了彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,生態生態生態  生態平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,還在睡覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小龍  好冷淡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚不是說過今天要開始上學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,開學典禮啊  恭喜你升年級了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這是對迎接新學年的兒子該展示的態度嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,這個房間很暗  把窗簾拉開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,已經拉開了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都住著什麼樣的傢伙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.99,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗圆_GBK\b0\bord0\shad0\c&H1C1C1E&\frz345.1\move(955.429,-46,956.572,133.429)}那東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,從那東西建好後  太陽的恩惠都被奪走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,害得清洗的衣服很難乾透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,每天每天  都會發霉發霉發霉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這個銳利的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小龍越來越像爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,越來越像…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:03:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,別拿我跟那種傢伙相提並…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,更加像爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小龍已經要走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的早餐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在老地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是絕對不想被這樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,都因為你誇讚的這個眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,高…高須
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你都幹了些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.10,Comment,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:40.95,Comment,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,請收下這些放過我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.25,0:04:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,現在就只有這些而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,硬幣零錢您肯定不要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕  那就是殺人之眼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.48,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\fs35\bord0\shad0\c&H1F2A2F&\pos(624,3)}失物寄放
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.48,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\fs30\bord0\shad0\c&H1C2528&\b0\pos(658.286,278.714)}大橋高校雜務處
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了  你還真經常撿到錢包啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果還是一個班級就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  是同班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕  又…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,今年也是一個班級呢  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,北村
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,本年的開學典禮到此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,請同學們回到各自的教室做好班會的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,新的班級
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又要從解開同學的誤會開始嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,最少不是全部人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是  也有像這樣理解我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而且在這個班級裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喲  北村
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,今年是同班呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是C班嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是高須吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,還記得我嗎  好像經常在北村身邊碰到你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是櫛枝實乃梨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,居然記住我的全名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼那麼  就讓我們一起清爽開朗地揮灑青春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我說  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我去一下洗手間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊  我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼快就要進行巔峰對決嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這個人和逢坂大河突然就開始了決賽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,老大爭奪戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好小的身板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,像人偶一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,給人一種莫名的威懾感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好像一不小心就會被吃掉一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,混混高須和掌中老虎…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.87,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\fs28\bord0\shad0\c&H1C2528&\b0\frz24.07\pos(250.286,268.428)}老虎一般的威懾感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.87,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\fs30\bord0\shad0\c&H1C2528&\b0\frz337.5\pos(1028.571,444.999)}但是很小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,掌中老虎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,掌中老…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不是名副其實嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好  今天就到此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒提交志願調查表的同學  稍後來一下辦公室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題吧  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,上學也比較晚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因為鼻炎去看醫生了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是室內粉塵什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,現代病
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,掌中老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙和櫛枝實乃梨是朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,明明遭殃的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,還好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂和高須好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,掌中老虎果然很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,話說高須只是樣子可怕  並不是混混
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,誤會好像很快就能解開呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大河?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,高…高須
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你對前途感到迷茫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但…但是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,志願調查表就只有你沒有交了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  不小心忘記…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.53,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,對前途感到迷茫  肯定不想被快奔三的單身剩女說教吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是不自量力…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,弄得這麼晚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,限時促銷要結束…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沒…沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,書包  書包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,總之無視別管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹…幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,問我在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  我只是拿書包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的書包嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的座位應該是旁邊的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是列…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,列…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,為…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要搶我的書包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  別鬧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,逢…逢坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸他在天國
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是個很帥的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他說為了不用擔心被人捅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在肚皮上隨時放著一本週刊雜誌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,迷死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就因為很像你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,才給我造成很大的麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是長成這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家就不會怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,也不會被掌中老虎纏上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也會對自己更加自信一些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:10.60,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fs28\bord0\shad0\c&H3F3D38&\b0\frz359.7\pos(603.429,499.286)}Best Drive Collection春
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,志願調查表
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,給北村祐作同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這是放錯書包的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒看裡面的東西  也完全想像不出裡面的內容
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,還給你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要貼回去才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,非常笨拙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,泰子?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,還不到她回來的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好  讓我們繼續喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:20.09,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\shad0\c&H84372C&\3c&HECEDEA&\frz352.6\pos(898.286,582.571)}工作中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.88,Comment,,0,0,0,,很棒  未羅乃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,窗戶…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  這個尺寸好像在哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,給我用紙巾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,幹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,給我忘記吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要我忘記…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是那封…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,信…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,既然被你知道了  我也活不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只能自殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也別殺我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我不想死  所以只好把你殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不想死的話  就給我失憶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,用這個敲打你的天靈蓋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然死不了  但是記憶什麼的應該能抹消掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要抹消啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:13:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,聽我說  那封信…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了  吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你看過了吧  讀過了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不聽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  那封情…那封情書的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,給我忘掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面是空的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,空…的?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  所以別說內容了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不如說沒交給北村真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒讓他知道這種醜態
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底有多餓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,便利店已經吃膩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,便利店?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼你的父母不做…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,每家都有一本難念的經啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你那時候乖乖把書包給我就不會這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎麼賠我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,臉上還有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,被你這種為了讓炒飯的油搭配大蒜味而出生的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,情書哪裡丟人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,聽好了  那種根本就不丟人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,知道這是什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那是以我要為喜歡的女生舉辦演唱會為主題而做的列表
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是為她即興作的詩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她一起去兜風時要聽的MD  我當然沒有駕照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有著春夏秋冬四種主題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣  很噁心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因為沒有告白的勇氣  所以只能這樣妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣確實很沒有出息
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我並不覺得丟人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你可以自信一點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你並不只是妄想  而是打算付諸行動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,往好的方面看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要清爽  開朗地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,獻給櫛枝實乃梨小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  就像櫛枝實乃梨一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然對實乃梨…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真囂張
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不自量力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死  你也沒資格說我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  不是叫你忘記嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,冷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸚對不起  吵醒你了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你讓我看什麼東西啊  噁心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼  居然這樣說我重要的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  小鸚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,給客人來個自我介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,今天終於能說出自己的名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,鸚…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不  小鸚今天不是狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,已經這麼晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,總之我們是一條船上的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那件事我不會告訴別人的  相信我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再說都請你吃飯了  給我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不  請你回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我某種意義上有點問題的媽媽要回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  情書怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,現在不流行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在這種時候扭扭捏捏的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,戀愛諮詢我隨時奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但是已經不早了  明天再說好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎  你願意幫我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我做  我做我做我做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼都做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事都要哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,會像狗一樣忠誠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,對我唯命是從嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我做  我發誓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎  好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙怎麼從窗戶進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我住很近
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我還帶著木刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不  那樣才危險
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我說  那個洞…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那種程度隨便找點紙補一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的話用這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要花錢的話  之後我會付的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再見  龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才她直接叫我名字了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  我是高…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快給我過來  你不是發過誓…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你掛我電話了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要我快點去哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,陽台嗎  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你答應過會像狗一樣唯命是從吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天我是指你和北村的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不來的話  你知道會有什麼後果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,現在讓你明白也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等我10分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,雜燴飯還有10分鐘就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,3?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好豪華
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,門開著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼味道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我進來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好誇張的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,逢坂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我…請務必讓我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,打掃這裡的廚房
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,睡回籠覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就像人工製造一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,睡著的逢坂就像真正的人偶一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這間沒有居家感的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是扮家家酒用的道具一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是作為人偶的房子來說也太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,15分鐘左右嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然還在打掃中  不過乾淨很多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,非常誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,水槽的積水都發臭了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,排水溝全是黏液黴菌和發臭的垃圾  簡直是地獄繪圖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,房間也到處是灰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,非法侵入  還強制打掃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你這條狗沒在這裡用氣味做記號吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.12,0:22:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,狗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.98,0:22:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣對狗太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,同樣是狗  你也是劣等狗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,劣等狗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.00,0:22:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好一個不懂感恩的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,人家好心特地…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂「我開動了」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大米的神明和各位勞動者  我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  你不流鼻涕了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因為這裡變乾淨了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛剛說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,亂七八糟的協定  因此產生的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,遺傳因子的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.03,0:25:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  你的笨拙程度真讓人佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.53,0:25:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴  然後給我爛掉
